{"ref":"BDB, גָּבַל","hw":"גָּבַל","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גָּבַל</span>]</big>  <strong>vb.denom. bound, border</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽבְלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.14\">Dt 19:14</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְבּוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:20\" href=\"/Joshua.18.20\">Jos 18:20</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְבָּל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.2\">Zc 9:2</a>;—<em>bound, border</em>, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:20\" href=\"/Joshua.18.20\">Jos 18:20</a> (P); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <em>border upon, adjoin</em> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.2\">Zc 9:2</a>; trans. <em>set bounds</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.14\">Dt 19:14</a> (c. acc. cogn.)<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 2 ms. <em>set bounds for</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִגְבַּלְתָּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:12\" href=\"/Exodus.19.12\">Ex 19:12</a>; Imv. <em>id.</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְבֵּל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:23\" href=\"/Exodus.19.23\">23</a> (both JE), + Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגְבִּיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.18\">Ez 47:18</a> 𝔊 𝔖 𝔙 Co.","next":"BDB, גְּבַל","prev":"BDB, מִגְבָּלֹת"}